                <l xml:id="m-d99d4ebb-17e9-4168-a9a9-fbf12096a3a0" facs="#m-6afbcea5-c893-4987-8ec1-7a1fc87bf082" label="text-like">At Mass</l><l xml:id="m-1ae6eb9b-6b9b-4b89-9c52-5fcb520982e7" facs="#m-2b12387e-c863-4a1d-ab7d-77a89a9e828d" label="ambiguous">043</l><l xml:id="m-3b11e575-025b-4346-bc5f-54bca36e8ea5" facs="#m-a7ebcfad-0878-460a-9ea0-0368f978a195" label="lyrics-like">V. Pánem Ange-lórum manducávit hómo. Gló-ri-a Pátri,</l><l xml:id="m-166de16f-5717-4850-bc9b-af071c0be7af" facs="#m-02f6aee7-8955-4a6e-873a-a353b644a22c" label="lyrics-like">et Fi-li-o, et Spi-rí-tu-i Sáncto.</l><l xml:id="m-dd4ae493-45c5-4e5d-8ffc-e7d1bacc979f" facs="#m-e0c7deae-f5cd-4102-8fac-71b2000d34e3" label="lyrics-like">v. Cibávit illos ex ádipe fruménti, allelúia.</l><l xml:id="m-3e3634e9-b231-4209-9238-cc80d27ddb8f" facs="#m-a47812eb-927a-432b-b42a-0be53a97ffaf" label="lyrics-like">R. Et de pétra, mélle saturávit éos, allelúia.</l><l xml:id="m-82ed7fd8-727a-4bed-b0df-56261083efbd" facs="#m-f6c9f415-b122-4e93-b7b5-fc7607f0df88" label="text-like">AT MASS. ()</l><l xml:id="m-880a9da8-e673-4dbb-bc73-3de3c7b89306" facs="#m-e588462c-5e3c-4941-ae9b-d9cf0838bc55" label="ambiguous">Intr.</l><l xml:id="m-f396594d-641e-4a1c-a03a-558f2f05dc7d" facs="#m-7717e70c-c8fb-4c6d-967c-3cafb4c948e3" label="ambiguous">2.</l><l xml:id="m-16dd7e29-ac0d-4dcd-8ede-2465ec76fe06" facs="#m-ca1eaa10-9a23-40c7-bea3-f347e5b3174a" label="lyrics-like">Ibá-vit é¬ os “ ex ádi- pe frumén¬ ti, alle¬</l><l xml:id="m-ef20c3f7-e171-46e0-94c1-34d2978b5d62" facs="#m-94507e0f-612f-43c4-864d-f5d25ac34dda" label="ambiguous">A</l><l xml:id="m-13f9517d-3154-4566-8d09-fb8fb6e4e3d2" facs="#m-dfbcd971-203b-4ce6-aae3-636d7fc76a40" label="lyrics-like">lú- ia: et de pé-tra, mélle</l><l xml:id="m-69e0d958-d40f-41aa-aaff-5016271ff6cc" facs="#m-a72d8fc9-a5df-4b1e-9aee-4c3e0a8903b1" label="lyrics-like">sa-tu-rá-vit é-os,</l><l xml:id="m-d310ea8b-f7c4-4148-b3aa-fea90b338571" facs="#m-a008bdf0-b1eb-427e-97a0-52a71c11eb0f" label="lyrics-like">alle-lú- ia, al-le-lú¬ ia, al-le¬</l><l xml:id="m-2f50dadb-edb8-4d43-bbfd-35a55370598c" facs="#m-bae796f9-22bf-4720-8037-642b63ed5dd9" label="lyrics-like">lú- ia.</l><l xml:id="m-53315b13-4409-4ea3-a5cd-42ad73b2e3a2" facs="#m-09232329-946a-459b-88be-055e6d459dae" label="lyrics-like">Ps. Exsul-tá-te Dé-o adju-tó-ri nóstro:"ju-bi-lá-te Dé¬o</l><l xml:id="m-bbce1d20-dbcd-409e-9683-72fe55d99dc1" facs="#m-65b957eb-972e-4cc7-9994-10547b8c8fa7" label="lyrics-like">Já-cob. Gló-ri-a Pátri. Eu o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-ce31db0c-9d08-490a-a7dc-67a8f5a2aa64" facs="#m-c64147ac-e4c6-49b5-a261-c0024687c322" label="ambiguous">collect.</l><l xml:id="m-76d7de95-ecf7-48c6-b27c-1fbbd9f0e56b" facs="#m-3a3dfdd3-1c5d-4458-8c24-94b1a5e1c0c4" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui nobis sub Sacraménto! sacra mystéria venerári; *ut red¬</l><l xml:id="m-91af9c19-f520-447c-8b6a-7a6a024e79c1" facs="#m-abfb7343-8131-4e91-a8cc-5bb499ba58e0" label="lyrics-like"> mirábili passiónis tuae memó-lemptiónis tuae fructum in nobis</l><l xml:id="m-e0b26406-988d-4fa6-a704-0efc4a37ca43" facs="#m-024f96a7-4dc8-4132-bbde-1257b4d7de6c" label="lyrics-like">júgiter sentiámus. Qui vivis et re¬</l><l xml:id="m-dfbde2bc-31df-4674-8042-13265d30cdc5" facs="#m-e9d3493a-00f0-4ef1-a757-d3376b811a62" label="lyrics-like">riam reliquísti :t tribue, quaésumus,</l><l xml:id="m-6b1793f2-123e-4541-b467-2f81c37dbccd" facs="#m-dae011f0-68a0-4747-bc71-9830135ca261" label="lyrics-like">ita nos córporis et sánguinis tuil gnas cum Deo Patre in unitáte.</l><l xml:id="m-6645db02-8ed0-44b6-a72a-478c80664bd1" facs="#m-bd16bd3b-382b-491c-9b31-4a46f74cc192" label="ambiguous">Lectio Epistolae beati Pauli Apostoli ad Corinthios. I. Cor. II.d.</l><l xml:id="m-e70efc62-fb37-4a75-924a-e3a0fa9c9c70" facs="#m-87026e35-867d-4f52-a413-16e2e56391de" label="lyrics-like">VRatres: Ego enim accépi a nocte tradebátur, accépit panem, et</l><l xml:id="m-bdab5461-b2ed-4d65-a43d-81ff472abf02" facs="#m-f0a2e8e1-a5ff-48ab-859e-36e3fe109981" label="lyrics-like">TDómino quod et trádidi vobis: grátias agens fregit, et dixit : Acci¬</l><l xml:id="m-030a06d3-3f06-4376-a68b-35920ed99c64" facs="#m-433b7429-e196-4772-8219-1eda4ce20310" label="lyrics-like">quóniam Dóminus Jesus, in qua! pite, et manducáte: Hoc est corpus</l><l xml:id="m-07f7e174-e8a2-4217-a7f4-11cace3a0178" facs="#m-649c9f5c-abba-4349-b0cf-8d3aa6198a29" label="text-like">(?) Votive Mass of the Blessed Sacrament. 1282.</l></lg>
            </div>
